    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T16:51:45Z",
    "body": "The label `blocked` is removed. The blocker is merged: #2620 is closed by PR #3363 (merge commit 87fb95f29). The crate `camcraft-gpu` is on `main`.\n\nThis issue is in the pick queue of the bug lane again. Its turn is after the open `P1` work and after PR #3353.\n\nA note for the worker: the comment of 11:28Z says that this slice needs a dependency from `camcraft-gpu` to `camcraft-sim`. A new dependency between our crates needs a `docs/decisions/` entry in the same PR (AGENTS.md, \"No new dependency between our crates without a decision\"). The facts about the GPU interface are on #2621.\n\n#2629 stays `blocked`: it waits for this issue and for #2611.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
